    "detailed_description": "Meet Me on the Mountain is a tale of discovery, of recollection, and of promises unfulfilled. This is the story of Julia, a photographer whose monotonous life is broken by the discovery of letters sent to her by A, a mysterious figure from her past, accompanied by photos of them she has no recollection of ever taking.<br><br>Pulled into the world within each photo \u2014 a familiar house, lush greenery, and a towering mountain in the distance \u2014 Julia must relive the past, reframe what she sees behind the lens, and recapture what has been lost to her.<br><br>Where will her memories lead her? Who is this mysterious A haunting her present?<br><br><strong>A Story From the Heart</strong><br>Experience a deeply personal narrative about reconnecting with the past, featuring authentic characters built-up over 200 lines of soul-stirring dialogue.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2282930/extras/0955af25c6dc6eae8644162433b3e7bf.avif?t=1704266795\" data-has-big /></span><br><br><strong>A Work of Art</strong><br>See the world around Julia brought to life with beautifully hand-painted scenes, accompanied by a resonating original soundtrack that evokes a feeling of missing home.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2282930/extras/cad88fc587edfdc9a460cbf899021fe0.poster.avif?t=1704266795\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2282930/extras/cad88fc587edfdc9a460cbf899021fe0.webm?t=1704266795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2282930/extras/cad88fc587edfdc9a460cbf899021fe0.mp4?t=1704266795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Experience-driven puzzles</strong><br>Unravel Julia's inner thoughts by wo